    "summary": "In [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), this model can pick an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE** model of yours up to 3\" from it. That model gets back as many as D3 lost wounds, and one of its ranged weapons that you pick gets **[[RAPID FIRE 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/rapid-fire)** until [your next Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase).\n\nA model can be picked only once per turn, whether for this ability or for **Blessing of the Omnissiah**.",
